      "reading_order": 205,
      "section": "WARNING:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 412.72182,
        "r": 197.11,
        "b": 401.48181999999997
      },
      "content": "WARNING:",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0188",
      "reading_order": 206,
      "section": "WARNING:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 153.00002,
        "t": 398.92183,
        "r": 490.8200200000002,
        "b": 387.68183
      },
      "content": "Make sure that the unit cannot roll or fall over and injure people or damage property."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0189",
      "reading_order": 207,
      "section": "WARNING:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 153.0,
        "t": 385.12184,
        "r": 540.5900000000004,
        "b": 361.88184
      },
      "content": "These pumps might use carbon or ceramic silicon carbide components. Do not drop the pump or subject it to shock loads as this can damage the internal ceramic components."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0190",
      "reading_order": 208,
      "section": "WARNING:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 143.99996,
        "t": 341.12185,
        "r": 545.3399700000007,
        "b": 317.88185
      },
      "content": "NOTICE: Use a forklift truck or an overhead crane with sufficient capacity to move the pallet with the pump unit on top. Failure to do so can result in equipment damage."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0191",
